USER TEST PLAN

1. Purpose of the Test

The goal is to evaluate whether the Stress Timer component helps users stay focused by:

Starting a timed session easily

Understanding the visual feedback (tree growth)

Adjusting duration

Pausing and resetting

2. Test Environment

Device: Laptop 

Browser: Chrome 

Build: Demo app running locally or deployed version

5. Tasks


## Task 1 — Start a Timer Session

Steps for tester:

Log in

Navigate to Timer page

Press Start

Success:

Timer starts without confusion

Tree begins animation

## Task 2 — Understand Visual Feedback

Steps:

Watch the tree grow


Success:

Tester can explain what the visuals mean without you explaining

## Task 3 — Change Session Duration

Steps:

Change duration from default (e.g., 2 → 5 minutes)

Start a session

Success:

Timer updates correctly

## Task 4 — Pause and Reset

Steps:

Pause

Reset

Start again

Success:

All controls behave correctly

No freezing or broken animation

